{"PageNumber":265,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":52,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِذۡ دَخَلُواْ عَلَيۡهِ فَقَالُواْ سَلَٰمٗا قَالَ إِنَّا مِنكُمۡ وَجِلُونَ","TajweedText":"إِذْ دَخَلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَلَيْهِ فَقَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> سَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>مًا ق</tajweed>َالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>ُمْ وَجِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٢</span>","End":"٥٢","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":53,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ لَا تَوۡجَلۡ إِنَّا نُبَشِّرُكَ بِغُلَٰمٍ عَلِيمٖ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لَا تَوْجَلْ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا نُبَشِّرُكَ بِغُلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مٍ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٍ <span class=end>٥٣</span>","End":"٥٣","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":54,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ أَبَشَّرۡتُمُونِي عَلَىٰٓ أَن مَّسَّنِيَ ٱلۡكِبَرُ فَبِمَ تُبَشِّرُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ أَبَشَّرْتُمُونِى عَلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن م</tajweed>َّسَّنِىَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكِبَرُ فَبِمَ تُبَشِّر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٤</span>","End":"٥٤","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":55,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ بَشَّرۡنَٰكَ بِٱلۡحَقِّ فَلَا تَكُن مِّنَ ٱلۡقَٰنِطِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بَشَّرْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ فَلَا تَك<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ُن م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نِط<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٥</span>","End":"٥٥","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":56,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ وَمَن يَقۡنَطُ مِن رَّحۡمَةِ رَبِّهِۦٓ إِلَّا ٱلضَّآلُّونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ وَم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَطُ م<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ِن ر</tajweed>َّحْمَةِ رَبِّه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> إِلَّا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ضّ<tajweed class=madda_necessary>َا</tajweed>ٓلّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٦</span>","End":"٥٦","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":57,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَمَا خَطۡبُكُمۡ أَيُّهَا ٱلۡمُرۡسَلُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَمَا خَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed>بُكُمْ أَيُّهَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُرْسَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٧</span>","End":"٥٧","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":58,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّآ أُرۡسِلۡنَآ إِلَىٰ قَوۡمٖ مُّجۡرِمِينَ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أُرْسِلْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَىٰ قَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٍ م</tajweed>ُّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>رِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٨</span>","End":"٥٨","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":59,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَّآ ءَالَ لُوطٍ إِنَّا لَمُنَجُّوهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"إِلّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> ءَالَ لُوطٍ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَمُنَجُّوهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٩</span>","End":"٥٩","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":60,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَّا ٱمۡرَأَتَهُۥ قَدَّرۡنَآ إِنَّهَا لَمِنَ ٱلۡغَٰبِرِينَ","TajweedText":"إِلَّا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>مْرَأَتَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> قَدَّرْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ‌ۙ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهَا لَمِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٠</span>","End":"٦٠","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":221,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":61,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَ ءَالَ لُوطٍ ٱلۡمُرۡسَلُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ ءَالَ لُوطٍ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُرْسَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦١</span>","End":"٦١","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":62,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ إِنَّكُمۡ قَوۡمٞ مُّنكَرُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ قَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٌ م</tajweed>ُّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٢</span>","End":"٦٢","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":63,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ بَلۡ جِئۡنَٰكَ بِمَا كَانُواْ فِيهِ يَمۡتَرُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بَلْ جِئْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كَ بِمَا كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فِيهِ يَمْتَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٣</span>","End":"٦٣","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":64,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَتَيۡنَٰكَ بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَإِنَّا لَصَٰدِقُونَ","TajweedText":"وَأَتَيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقِّ وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَصَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٤</span>","End":"٦٤","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":65,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَسۡرِ بِأَهۡلِكَ بِقِطۡعٖ مِّنَ ٱلَّيۡلِ وَٱتَّبِعۡ أَدۡبَٰرَهُمۡ وَلَا يَلۡتَفِتۡ مِنكُمۡ أَحَدٞ وَٱمۡضُواْ حَيۡثُ تُؤۡمَرُونَ","TajweedText":"فَأَسْرِ بِأَهْلِكَ بِقِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>عٍ م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّيْلِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّبِعْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>بَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رَهُمْ وَلَا يَلْتَفِتْ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>ُمْ أَحَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>دٌ و</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>مْضُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> حَيْثُ تُؤْمَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٥</span>","End":"٦٥","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":66,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَضَيۡنَآ إِلَيۡهِ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡأَمۡرَ أَنَّ دَابِرَ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ مَقۡطُوعٞ مُّصۡبِحِينَ","TajweedText":"وَقَضَيْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَيْهِ ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَمْرَ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ دَابِرَ هَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ؤُل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ مَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>طُو<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>عٌ م</tajweed>ُّصْبِح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٦</span>","End":"٦٦","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":67,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَجَآءَ أَهۡلُ ٱلۡمَدِينَةِ يَسۡتَبۡشِرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ أَهْلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَدِينَةِ يَسْتَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>شِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٧</span>","End":"٦٧","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":68,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ضَيۡفِي فَلَا تَفۡضَحُونِ","TajweedText":"قَالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ هَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ـٰٓ</tajweed>ؤُل<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ ضَيْفِى فَلَا تَفْضَح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٦٨</span>","End":"٦٨","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":69,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱتَّقُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَلَا تُخۡزُونِ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهَ وَلَا تُخْز<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٦٩</span>","End":"٦٩","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":70,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ أَوَلَمۡ نَنۡهَكَ عَنِ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَوَلَمْ نَنْهَكَ عَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٠</span>","End":"٧٠","PageNumber":265,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":222,"MaqraNumber":106,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false}]}